                <note rend="inline" type="source">823.30/110: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dearing</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-09-09T18:00:00-05:00">September 9, 1930—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 7:37 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>196. My 190, September 6, 7 p.m. Sutton released; returned home today. Grow
                    released; expected to arrive Lima 11th on the steamer <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Rimac.</hi></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dearing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
